{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02411",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 5.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.25,
      "end_seconds": 10.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.34,
      "end_seconds": 16.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Let me think, thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.66,
      "end_seconds": 23.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Well, I've been having being breathless on stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.63,
      "end_seconds": 28.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 29.86,
      "end_seconds": 34.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "So, it's Foracort inhaler, twice a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.37,
      "end_seconds": 38.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "So, how long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 40.09,
      "end_seconds": 55.94,
      "duration_seconds": 15.85,
      "text": "About three months now. Erm, she takes alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week. Um, it's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day for my heart, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.11,
      "end_seconds": 58.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.91,
      "end_seconds": 64.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Yesterday, it came on out of nowhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.74,
      "end_seconds": 68.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I follow. How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.81,
      "end_seconds": 71.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.31,
      "end_seconds": 75.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Is it worse at certain times?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.91,
      "end_seconds": 81.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Erm, stairs definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.91,
      "end_seconds": 85.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.96,
      "end_seconds": 98.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "It just comes and goes. Let me think, and there's very heavy periods as well, about a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.56,
      "end_seconds": 104.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Have you been feeling exhausted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.15,
      "end_seconds": 112.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Yes, since Friday. As for feeling exhausted, moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.44,
      "end_seconds": 119.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "Have you had being breathless on stairs before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.84,
      "end_seconds": 129.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.83,
      "end_seconds": 146.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "And what about fainting, pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.02,
      "end_seconds": 152.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Let me think, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.21,
      "end_seconds": 158.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Right, anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.26,
      "end_seconds": 162.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Yeah, nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.9,
      "end_seconds": 170.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.09,
      "end_seconds": 173.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.18,
      "end_seconds": 191.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.81,
      "end_seconds": 204.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I look after my grandchildren most days. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.01,
      "end_seconds": 208.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.52,
      "end_seconds": 217.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "I mean, yes, I had two stents put in my heart, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.93,
      "end_seconds": 225.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.59,
      "end_seconds": 228.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Yes, asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.66,
      "end_seconds": 231.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.88,
      "end_seconds": 236.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Thin bones, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.37,
      "end_seconds": 241.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.09,
      "end_seconds": 245.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.83,
      "end_seconds": 247.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.86,
      "end_seconds": 265.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.2,
      "end_seconds": 279.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.0,
      "end_seconds": 305.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse 116, BP is 131 over 82. And saturation 96 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.1,
      "end_seconds": 307.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.23,
      "end_seconds": 315.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.22,
      "end_seconds": 320.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Alright, shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.36,
      "end_seconds": 323.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.83,
      "end_seconds": 341.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Your inner eyelids are pale and your pulse is a little fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.79,
      "end_seconds": 372.87,
      "duration_seconds": 26.08,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like heavy periods with iron deficiency. A blood count is what I'd like next, for heavy periods. We should do a ferritin level for heavy periods. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like to arrange a pelvic ultrasound for heavy periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.86,
      "end_seconds": 380.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "For this, ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, three months. That's for iron deficiency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.26,
      "end_seconds": 386.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Okay, so alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.37,
      "end_seconds": 408.95,
      "duration_seconds": 20.58,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on tranexamic acid, 1 gram, three times a day, during periods. That should help with heavy periods. Keep a pad count diary. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. I'd like you back after the results. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.64,
      "end_seconds": 412.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}